PortLogisticsContext *-- PhysicalResourceDataModel : manages

note right of PhysicalResource
  **Aggregate Root**
  Enforces business rules:
  - Code unique & alphanumeric (BR1)
  - Description required
  - Type: Crane, Truck, Forklift
  - Capacity > 0 (BR4)
  - SetupTime >= 0 (BR5)
  - Status transitions (BR3)
  - Soft delete (Inactive status)
  - Audit trail (BR7)
end note

note right of PhysicalResourceService
  **Application Service**
  Orchestrates:
  - Code uniqueness check
  - Status transition validation
  - Domain validation
  - Audit logging (changedBy, operationType)
  - Persistence operations
  - DTO mapping
end note

